## 9. Performance Optimisation

| Technique | Tool | How to implement |
|-----------|------|------------------|
| **Image optimisation** | `next/image` | Replace `<img>` with `<Image>` component |
| **Code splitting** | Next.js automatic | Import components lazily (`dynamic(() => import('./HeavyComponent'))`) |
| **Lazy loading** | IntersectionObserver | Use `loading="lazy"` on images, `react-lazyload` for components |
| **Prefetching** | Next.js `prefetch` | `<Link prefetch={true}>` |
| **Service Worker** | Workbox | Add `next-pwa` plugin |
| **Bundle size** | Bundle Analyzer | `next-bundle-analyzer` |
| **Critical CSS** | `next/font` | Use `@next/font` for self‑hosting fonts |

### Example: Image Component

```tsx
import Image from 'next/image';

export const ProductImage = ({ src, alt }) => (
  <Image
    src={src}
    alt={alt}
    width={640}
    height={480}
    layout="responsive"
    objectFit="cover"
    priority // for hero images
  />
);
```

