## 13. Deployment Checklist

| Item | Done? |
|------|-------|
| **Environment variables** | `.env.production` contains `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY`, `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY`, `SENTRY_DSN` |
| **HTTPS** | Vercel provides SSL automatically |
| **Domain** | Point DNS to Vercel |
| **Cache headers** | `next.config.js` `headers()` for static assets |
| **CDN** | Vercel’s Edge Network |
| **SEO** | Meta tags, OpenGraph, Twitter cards |
| **Accessibility** | Lighthouse audit, axe-core |
| **Analytics** | Plausible script in `_document.tsx` |
| **Backup** | Database snapshots (if using managed DB) |
| **Rollback** | Vercel preview deployments |

