## 14. Maintenance & Scaling

| Topic | Action |
|-------|--------|
| **Feature flags** | LaunchDarkly, Split.io, or simple env var toggles |
| **A/B testing** | Google Optimize, Optimizely |
| **Internationalisation** | `next-i18next` or `react-intl` |
| **Progressive Web App** | `next-pwa` plugin, service worker |
| **Serverless scaling** | Vercel auto‑scales API routes |
| **Database scaling** | Read replicas, sharding if needed |
| **Security** | Regular dependency audit (`npm audit`), OWASP Top 10 checks |

