### Final Thought

Building a robust e‑commerce frontend is a marathon, not a sprint.  
Start small—get a minimal viable product (MVP) running with a handful of products, then iterate.  
Use the above playbook as a living reference; keep your documentation up‑to‑date, and always measure the impact of changes on your KPIs.

Happy coding! 🚀
